    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What runs now",
      "items": [
        "Generation, snapshot validation, standalone quarantine, and ClickHouse storage are current committed code.",
        "The loader reads the same validated input, appends accepted rows, and reports rejected counts without writing quarantine.jsonl."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failure branches",
      "items": [
        "A bad manifest, hash, or row count aborts the snapshot before row quarantine.",
        "Invalid rows get safe reasons in quarantine.jsonl only when the standalone validation command is run.",
        "The loader reports rejected counts but does not persist quarantine.jsonl. Changed payloads for one source key block guarded logical reads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Next M1 slice",
      "items": [
        "Episodes and exposure must be derived independently from logical samples.",
        "The fixture's one episode and 66 m denominator are hand-calculated expectations, not implemented metric output.",
        "The API and React explorer are target components, not running services."
